<title>PHILIPPINES: Empire buys back 6.356 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Empire buys back 6.356 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Empire East Land Holdings Inc said on Wednesday it has purchased 6.356 million of its own shares at three pesos apiece from the market.</p>
<p>In April, the company's board of directors approved a buyback of its shares to be retired as treasury stock, the company said in a statement to the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
